<CONTENT>For the City of Madison (Florida) Police Officers' and Firefighters' Retirement System RFP No. 2025-0901 for investment consulting services, the proposal deadline is 2:00 p.m. on September 1, 2025. Any proposal received after 2:00 p.m. on that date will be returned unopened.

