## Markdown Briefing

### BCERS Alternatives Consultant RFP: Years-in-Business Requirement

- The proposing firm must have been in business for **at least seven (7) years**.
- This requirement appears in **Section I.E, “Minimum Qualifications.”**
- The RFP states: **“The firm must have been in business for at least seven (7) or more years providing general consulting services plus private equity consulting services or alternatives consulting services only.”**
- This is a **mandatory minimum qualification**.
- Failure to meet this requirement may result in **immediate rejection** of the proposal.
- All minimum qualifications had to be satisfied as of **November 8, 2024, 3:00 P.M. EDT**.

### Direct Answer
**Required minimum:** **Seven (7) years**
</SUMMARY>
