# Markdown Briefing

## SBCERS 2020 RFP: Minimum Business History Requirement

The **Santa Barbara County Employees’ Retirement System (SBCERS)** 2020 RFP for **discretionary private equity consultant services** requires that the proposing firm have been in business for at least **five (5) years**.

## Supporting Evidence
- **Section I.F – “Minimum Qualifications for Proposal,” item 1**:  
  “**The firm must have been in business at least five (5) years** providing services similar to those described in the Scope of Services section.”
- **Section III, Part B – “Questionnaire,” under “A. Minimum Qualifications,” item 1**:  
  Repeats the same **five (5) year** requirement.

## Conclusion
**Required minimum business history: five (5) years.**
</SUMMARY>
