<CONTENT>According to the City of Temple City 457 Deferred Compensation Plan administration and recordkeeping RFP, the plan, as of March 31, 2020, had 31 actively contributing participants and 15 non-active participants, for a total of 46 participants with a balance. The RFP also states that total plan assets were $1,894,729 during that same period.</CONTENT>
