[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>The evidence directly states when the INREV Funds of Funds / Multi Manager DDQ was originally launched, identifies the two additions placed at the front of the DDQ, and specifies the permitted length of the manager’s statement. These points all appear in the Introduction and the “Funds of Funds / Multi Manager Statement” section.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>FoF/MM DDQ key facts</NAME>
<CONTENT>The FoF / MM questionnaire was originally launched in 2014.

The two additions that appear at the front of the DDQ are:
1. a Vehicle Fact Sheet, which provides a snapshot of the basic high-level vehicle information; and
2. a Funds of Funds / Multi Manager Statement, which gives the manager the opportunity to showcase its platform and expertise.

The manager’s statement may be no more than one page long. The document says the statement should be short, no more than one page, and should outline what distinguishes the manager and vehicle from competitors and competing offerings.</CONTENT>
[role=assistant] <SUMMARY>
# Markdown Briefing

## INREV FoF / MM DDQ 2022: Key Facts

- **Original launch year:** **2014**
- **Two additions at the front of the DDQ:**
  - **Vehicle Fact Sheet** — a snapshot of basic, high-level vehicle information
  - **Funds of Funds / Multi Manager Statement** — allows the manager to present its platform and expertise
- **Maximum length of the manager’s statement:** **No more than one page**

## Notes
- The manager’s statement should be **short** and explain what differentiates the manager and vehicle from competitors and competing offerings.
</SUMMARY>
