[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>According to the ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire v1.2, version 1.1 was released in September 2016. It introduced new questions on compliance with the ILPA Reporting Template, revised the Governance and Risk/Compliance/ESG sections to reflect PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ and to reorganize/edit existing questions, and refreshed web links, font, and formatting.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>Version 1.1 changes</NAME>
<CONTENT>Under the “New in Version 1.1” section of the ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire v1.2, version 1.1 was released in September 2016.

The changes introduced in version 1.1 were:
- Added new questions regarding compliance with the ILPA Reporting Template, which had been released in January 2016, in the “Accounting / Valuation / Reporting” sections.
- Revised the original “Governance” and “Risk / Compliance / ESG” sections to reflect PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ, and also re-ordered, merged, and edited existing questions from those sections.
- Refreshed existing web links, font, and formatting as needed.</CONTENT>
