# Briefing: ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire v1.2 — Version 1.1 Changes

## Release Date
- **Version 1.1 was released in September 2016.**

## Key Changes Introduced
- **ILPA Reporting Template compliance questions added**
  - New questions were introduced in the **Accounting / Valuation / Reporting** sections.
  - These addressed compliance with the **ILPA Reporting Template**, which had been released in **January 2016**.

- **Governance and Risk / Compliance / ESG sections revised**
  - The **Governance** and **Risk / Compliance / ESG** sections were updated to reflect **PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ**.
  - Existing questions in these sections were also **re-ordered, merged, and edited**.

- **Formatting and link updates**
  - Existing **web links, font, and formatting** were refreshed as needed.

## Concise Takeaway
- **September 2016 release**
- Main focus: **reporting template compliance**, **responsible investment DDQ alignment**, and **document refreshes**
</SUMMARY>
