- The other RFPs and procurement documents shown (TMRS, CTA Retirement Plan, IMRF, FPIF, Hawaii ERS, SDCERS) do not contain an equally clear direct reference to ILPA in the evidence provided here.
- Therefore, based on the supplied evidence, **the Arizona PSPRS RFP is the corpus document that refers to ILPA, and it does so to specify recommended alternative-investment portfolio metrics for consultant databases.**</CONTENT>
