<CONTENT>In the Anchorage Police and Fire Retirement System 2025 investment consultant RFP, the minimum amount of assets under management a firm must have is **$2 billion**.

Relevant language from the RFP:
- **Section 3.A.1, Minimum Consultant Requirements:** “**The firm must have at least $2 Billion under management**.”

This is listed as one of the mandatory minimum consultant requirements, alongside other requirements such as working with public pension funds, having a lead consultant with at least 10 years of investment experience, agreeing to serve as a fiduciary, and being registered under the Investment Advisers Act of 1940.</CONTENT>
