<CONTENT>The proposal submission deadline in the Oklahoma Public Employees Retirement System (OPERS) Investment Consulting Services RFP (#515-22-200) is:

- **4:30 p.m. Central Time on March 25, 2022**

Relevant supporting details from the RFP:
- The cover sheet states: **“Proposal Deadline must be received by 4:30 pm CT March 25, 2022.”**
- Section II.B, “Mandatory Requirements for Submitting a Proposal,” repeats that **the deadline for receipt of proposals is 4:30 p.m. Central Time, on March 25, 2022**.
- Proposals were required to be submitted digitally via the OPERS file submission link specified in the RFP.
- The RFP was issued on **February 18, 2022**.</CONTENT>
