# Markdown Briefing

## OPERS RFP Proposal Submission Deadline

The proposal submission deadline for the **Oklahoma Public Employees Retirement System (OPERS) Investment Consulting Services RFP (#515-22-200)** was:

- **4:30 p.m. Central Time on March 25, 2022**

## Supporting Evidence

- The **proposal cover sheet** states: **“Proposal Deadline must be received by 4:30 pm CT March 25, 2022.”**
- **Section II.B, Mandatory Requirements for Submitting a Proposal**, repeats that the deadline for receipt of proposals is **4:30 p.m. Central Time on March 25, 2022**.
- Proposals were required to be **submitted digitally** through the OPERS file submission link.
- The RFP was originally **issued on February 18, 2022**.

## Conclusion

The RFP clearly identifies the proposal deadline as **4:30 p.m. CT on March 25, 2022**, and this is confirmed in multiple sections of the document.

