[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>The questionnaire asks the firm to state whether it provides certain administrative/support services for fixed income insurance accounts and, if so, whether an additional fee applies and the approximate amount. The listed services appear in the administration section of the fixed income investment management services RFP.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>Services and extra fees</NAME>
<CONTENT>The firm is asked to indicate, for each of the following services, whether the service is offered and whether any additional fee is incurred, including the approximate fee amount:

- Schedule D investment accounting
- Asset/liability management (dynamic financial analysis)
- Performance attribution
- Daily internet access of portfolio information
- SVO filing

The questionnaire presents these under a table with columns equivalent to:
- Service
- Service Offered? (Yes/No)
- Approximate Fee

So the requested response is not just whether the firm offers each service, but also the approximate additional fee for any of them if applicable.</CONTENT>
