[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>In the September 2024 revision of ILPA’s ESG Assessment Framework FAQ, the answer to “Where can I find additional resources pertaining to ESG?” lists 8 resources. The evidence also shows this 2024 list updated and expanded the earlier version’s shorter resource list.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>2024 ESG resource list</NAME>
<CONTENT>In the 2024 version of ILPA’s ESG Assessment Framework FAQ, 8 resources are listed in response to “Where can I find additional resources pertaining to ESG?” They are:

1. ILPA’s ESG and Sustainable Investing Hub  
2. ILPA’s Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion Hub  
3. UNPRI's Private Equity Page  
4. The ESG Data Convergence Initiative  
5. The Private Markets Decarbonization Roadmap  
6. IFRS’s International Sustainability Standards Board (ISSB) — with the note that the Sustainability Accounting Standards Board (SASB), previously listed in the FAQ, is now part of the IFRS Foundation  
7. Task Force on Climate-Related Financial Disclosures — with the note that, after its 2023 status report, TCFD fulfilled its remit and disbanded, and the IFRS Foundation was asked to take over monitoring progress on companies’ climate-related disclosures  
8. The Institutional Investors Group on Climate Change (IIGCC)

The FAQ also states that this is not an exhaustive list, but rather a selection of resources that influenced or were referenced in the framework.</CONTENT>
