<NAME>INPRS fixed income hiring</NAME>
<CONTENT>Under INPRS RFP 22-04, INPRS anticipates hiring two Core Plus Fixed Income managers. The combined size of the mandate is approximately $185 million. The selected strategies will be benchmarked against the Bloomberg U.S. Aggregate Bond Index.</CONTENT>
[role=assistant] <SUMMARY>
## Markdown Briefing

**INPRS RFP 22-04** indicates that INPRS anticipates hiring:

- **Two** Core Plus Fixed Income managers
- With a **combined mandate size of approximately $185 million**
- Benchmarked against the **Bloomberg U.S. Aggregate Bond Index**

### Key Takeaway
INPRS plans to allocate about **$185 million** across **two Core Plus Fixed Income mandates**, with performance measured relative to the **Bloomberg U.S. Aggregate Bond Index**.
</SUMMARY>
