<CONTENT>The Broward Education Foundation, Inc. RFP says in Section III, “Brevity of Proposals,” that the proposal must be no longer than 5 single-spaced typewritten pages, not including backup documents.

For submission, Section V, “Submission of Proposals,” states that six (6) copies of the proposal must be submitted.

The deadline is no later than 5:00 PM on July 1, 2016.

So the answer is: submit six copies by 5:00 PM on July 1, 2016.</CONTENT>
